{
  "slug": "lead411",
  "name": "Lead411",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Search contacts and companies, enrich accounts, unlock contact details, and push records to CRM — one-click Lead411 MCP integration for Claude Code and Cowork.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `lead411-configure-crm` (Set up or review Lead411 CRM integration), `lead411-enrich` (Batch enrich a list of companies from a CSV, pasted list, or URL list with Lead411 firmographic and…), `lead411-get-company` (Get a full company profile including firmographics, tech stack, recent news, and job postings), `lead411-get-employee` (Get an enriched profile for a specific person or list employees at a company), `lead411-push-to-crm` (Push selected contacts or companies from Lead411 into the user's connected CRM), `lead411-search` (Search Lead411 for contacts or companies by title, industry, location, revenue, tech stack, or hiring signals), `lead411-unlock` (Reveal gated contact details (direct phone, work email) for a specific Lead411 contact)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `lead411`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lead411@claude-community` from `lead411/lead411-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "mcp": 1
  },
